      "id": "N_RUINED_CATHEDRAL_AT_THE_EDGE_OF_THE_VILLAGE",
      "name": "Ruined cathedral at the edge of the village",
      "cat": "Standard POI",
      "culture": "Adhocracy",
      "tier": 3,
      "customNotes": "# Ruined cathedral at the edge of the village\n\nA ruined cathedral at the edge of a somber, twilit village, where the townsfolk say strange rituals are performed. Something evil haunts the place, though its nature is not immediately clear.\n\n**Sights:** at the entrance to the church a dying man writhes in agony. Dim light seeps from the church doorway, and within, a stone stairway plunges down into darkness.\n\n**Smells:** below, the scent of death surrounds the hero.\n\n**Who is there:** an anxious and dwindling populace speaks of invasion by dark riders and of the rituals performed in the ruin.",
